<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n104088" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιτιγόνιον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>an insect like a</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέττιξ</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Epil.
				4
			</span></i> (where <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιττιγόνιον</span> cod.<i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>, the alphabetical order requiring <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιτιγόνιον; τρυγονίῳ</span> codd.AC<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
			</span></i>, cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῷον ὅμοιον τέττιγι καὶ τριγονίῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eust.
					1282.40
				</span></i>
			), prob. cj. in <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				556a20
			</span></i> (where <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τεττιγόνια</span>, with 
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριγόνια</span>
			, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιγόνιον: εἶδός τι
				Ἀριστοτέλει</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιγόνιον: ἐπὶ νηπίου
			τίθεται</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>); the word is correctly written in <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				760.47
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.Gr.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				87
			</span></i> (ap.<i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				396.2
			</span></i>, where it is rightly connected with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιτίζω</span>: it is prob. 
				Dim. of
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τιτιγών </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιτιγών</span>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιτίζω,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀλολυγών</span>
			: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀλολύζω,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρυγών</span>
			: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρύζω</span>)). (Perh. to be
			restored for <i>tetogonia</i>, v.l.
			<i>tetigometrae</i>, in <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				11.92
			</span></i>.)</div>
